            "review_title": "Review at Kohaku Sashimi & Yakiniku - Vincom Center",
            "review_text": "ZeroT\n26 contributions\n0\nDeliciousness!!!\nMay 2019 • Couples\nThis Japanese restaurant located within Vincom mall is an absolute gem!! The waitress was amazing! Her English skills were on point. The menu was mouth watering. Wish we had more room in our stomachs to try more! Anyhow we ordered about 7 rolls, and few other items and all items were exactly what we craved, fresh delicious sushi rolls. I think the staff was surprised we ordered so much, management even came and asked us how was everything. Because we were so happy to be eating the delicious food management even gave us some free ice cream desert that was absolutely refreshing to too off our dinner!! This place will definitely take care of you. Your stomach and taste buds will also thank you as well. Anytime a place treasures its customers is always a place I would recommend. Plus it's a perfect spot to catch dinner then catch a movie being in the same building.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 28, 2019",
